/**

# [Vulimg](index) Usage

The usage scheme is the same in both [C] and [C++] versions:

- Initialize the system by creating a `[Vulimg](Cpp#Vulimg)` object

- Create `[Image](Cpp#Image)` object(s). You can load them from BMP or RAW files 
  or fill the data directly through their [address](Cpp#Image.address)

- Use conversion or mainpulation functions of your liking

- You can write results as BMP or RAW files or just use the data through their
  [address](Cpp#Image.address)

You can find full examples in the test directory
